1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:02,893
Skin that feels tight, dull and thirsty?

2
00:00:02,893 --> 00:00:08,171
This is a full look at the Dermalogica Circular Hydration Serum: what it does, what

3
00:00:08,171 --> 00:00:10,014
is inside, and how to use it.

4
00:00:10,778 --> 00:00:15,515
This is a long-lasting serum that immediately floods skin with hydration.

5
00:00:15,515 --> 00:00:20,575
It replenishes skin from within, and helps prevent hydration from evaporating.

6
00:00:20,575 --> 00:00:25,507
So it works in a circle: it hydrates, it replenishes, and it helps hold that

7
00:00:25,507 --> 00:00:26,350
hydration in.

8
00:00:27,115 --> 00:00:32,183
It is suitable for all skin types, and especially for dryness or dehydration,

9
00:00:32,183 --> 00:00:34,948
dullness, fine lines, or loss of firmness.

10
00:00:34,948 --> 00:00:40,148
If your skin feels dry or dehydrated, this is the kind of serum built for that.

11
00:00:40,914 --> 00:00:45,925
The first key ingredient is an enhanced form of hyaluronic acid, to quench

12
00:00:45,925 --> 00:00:47,008
dehydrated skin.

13
00:00:47,008 --> 00:00:48,633
It immediately hydrates.

14
00:00:49,401 --> 00:00:54,329
An algae-extract moisturizing matrix is built in, and the hydration lasts throughout

15
00:00:54,329 --> 00:00:55,443
the day and beyond.

16
00:00:56,202 --> 00:01:01,780
Polyglutamic acid, from fermented soy, is part of the formula too, alongside the

17
00:01:01,780 --> 00:01:02,895
hyaluronic acid.

18
00:01:03,665 --> 00:01:06,012
So are plant sugars and amino acids.

19
00:01:06,712 --> 00:01:11,946
There is also a postbiotic blend of Lactobacillus ferment and oat extract.

20
00:01:11,946 --> 00:01:17,888
Hyaluronic acid, the algae matrix, polyglutamic acid, plant sugars, amino acids, and

21
00:01:17,888 --> 00:01:22,556
the postbiotic blend all work together for long-lasting hydration.

22
00:01:23,327 --> 00:01:24,588
Here is how to use it.

23
00:01:24,588 --> 00:01:26,996
Morning and night, cleanse and tone first.

24
00:01:27,696 --> 00:01:30,444
Then smooth the serum over your face and neck.

25
00:01:30,444 --> 00:01:33,968
For most people, four to six drops cover the face and neck.

26
00:01:34,668 --> 00:01:36,464
Apply your moisturizer after it.

27
00:01:36,464 --> 00:01:41,011
It layers under makeup, so you can wear it in the morning before the rest of your

28
00:01:41,011 --> 00:01:41,460
routine.

29
00:01:42,216 --> 00:01:43,833
Sensitive skin can use it.

30
00:01:43,833 --> 00:01:48,124
If you are sensitive to a specific ingredient, do a patch test first.

31
00:01:48,124 --> 00:01:50,301
It may have a subtle natural scent.

32
00:01:51,001 --> 00:01:54,733
It comes in ten, thirty and fifty-nine milliliter sizes.

33
00:01:54,733 --> 00:01:58,066
That was the Dermalogica Circular Hydration Serum.

34
00:01:58,066 --> 00:02:00,132
The link is in the description.
